## Explanation of the files and folders

This list some of the files in this project (mainly those created from the
template) as well as explains a bit more about them and what they are used for.

- `.copier-answers.yml`: Contains the answers you gave when copying the project
  from the template. **You should not modify this file directly.**
- `.github/`: Contains GitHub-specific files, such as
  [dependabot](https://docs.github.com/en/code-security/tutorials/secure-your-dependencies/dependabot-quickstart-guide)
  for updating the workflow versions and a workflow to automatically add pull
  requests and issues to DP-Next's [project board](https://github.com/orgs/dp-next/projects/15/views/1).
- `.gitignore`: This ignore file tells Git which files to not track. Unless you
  know what you are doing, it's best to not touch this file.
